Vendored yaml-cpp (1d8ca1f3): add missing <cstdint> include.

src/emitterutils.cpp uses uint16_t/uint32_t but never includes
<cstdint>; GCC 15 no longer provides it transitively ->
"'uint16_t' was not declared in this scope". Same fix as upstream
yaml-cpp applied later on their master. Applied to the vendored copy
after extraction into external/yaml-cpp/ (path prefix below matches
that staging location).

--- a/external/yaml-cpp/src/emitterutils.cpp
+++ b/external/yaml-cpp/src/emitterutils.cpp
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <algorithm>
 #include <iomanip>
 #include <sstream>
